{"acronym": "DI-TG", "archived": null, "badges": [], "contact_point": null, "created_at": "2024-12-03T17:42:54.691000+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Les infrastructures contribuent \u00e0 la r\u00e9ussite des activit\u00e9s manufacturi\u00e8res et agricoles. Les investissements dans l'eau, l'assainissement, l'\u00e9nergie, le logement et les transports am\u00e9liorent \u00e9galement les conditions de vie et contribuent \u00e0 r\u00e9duire la pauvret\u00e9. Enfin, les nouvelles technologies de l'information et de la communication favorisent la croissance, am\u00e9liorent la prestation des services de sant\u00e9 et autres, \u00e9tendent la port\u00e9e de l'\u00e9ducation et soutiennent les progr\u00e8s sociaux et culturels. Les donn\u00e9es pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es ici proviennent de sources telles que la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration routi\u00e8re internationale, Containerisation International, l'Organisation de l'aviation civile internationale, l'Association internationale de l'\u00e9nergie et l'Union internationale des t\u00e9l\u00e9communications.\nLes donn\u00e9es sont fournies sous la licence [Creative Commons Attribution International](https://data.humdata.org/faqs/licenses), permettant leur r\u00e9utilisation sous r\u00e9serve de citer la source.", "extras": {}, "frequency": "irregular", "frequency_date": null, "harvest": null, "id": "674f431eb2c1394bf570280a", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2024-12-03T17:42:54.691000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2024-12-20T16:28:42.836000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2024-12-20T16:28:42.836000+00:00", "last_update": "2024-12-16T17:46:31.254000+00:00", "license": "CC-BY-4.0", "metrics": {"discussions": 0, "followers": 0, "resources_downloads": 27, "reuses": 0, "views": 91}, "organization": {"acronym": "HDX", "badges": [{"kind": "association"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "674ed79eb2c1394bf57027f3", "logo": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/s/avatars/20/9d5b87a73342b382dd983b646b3bdc-original.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https:/